# Tic-Tac-Toe — Docker Practical

A simple Tic-Tac-Toe web application created as a classroom practical to understand the basic concepts of Docker and containerization.

## Project Overview

This project contains a simple Tic-Tac-Toe game built using Python and HTML. The application is then containerized using Docker so that it can run in an isolated and consistent environment.

The main purpose of this project is to understand how Docker can be used with a web application.

## Project Structure

